template into the user's project and installs its pinned lockfile. The
template's own files are part of Tenet and fall under the MIT license in the
template's LICENSE file. The packages below are NOT copied into Tenet; they are
downloaded by the user's package manager into the user's project, and their
licenses bind the user's project. Using Tenet does not require the user to
disclose application source and gives Tenet no ownership of it.

